#MOBILE
Vnum       40301
Keywords   kora ryo master temple~
Short      Kora Ryo~
Long       Kora Ryo sits at a broad table, surrounded by open records.
~
Desc       Kora Ryo, Master of Kaleth, carries the weight of the Order's
entire remembered history with a scholar's quiet patience. If it
happened on Tython and someone thought to write it down, Kora Ryo has
likely read it - and remembers what it left out.
~
Race       Human~
Position   sitting~
DefPos     sitting~
Gender     female~
Actflags   npc sentinel~
Affected   ~
