#ROOM
Vnum     40301
Name     Gate of Kaleth~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Kaleth's gate is unassuming beside the grander entrances of the
other Temples - a plain stone arch, worn smooth by generations of
scholars passing beneath it. A hush seems to begin here, well before
the archive proper.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40302
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40912
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40302
Name     The Great Archive~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Shelves rise far overhead in this vast, dim hall, packed with
records in more forms than you can easily name - bound volumes, data-
cylinders, and older media that predates them both. Every sound here
seems to be swallowed before it can echo.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40301
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40303
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    40304
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction west~
ToRoom    40305
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 40302 1 40302
Reset O 0 40301 5 40302
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40303
Name     Kora Ryo's Study~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Records cover every surface of this cluttered study, stacked in
an order that makes sense to exactly one person. Kora Ryo works here
most days, cross-referencing accounts that rarely agree with each
other as cleanly as the Order's official history suggests they should.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40302
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 40301 1 40303
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40304
Name     Reading Hall~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Long tables fill this quiet, well-lit hall, each spaced far
enough from its neighbors to discourage conversation. Initiates and
visiting scholars alike come here to read - and, more often than not,
to fall asleep over an open tome by midafternoon.
~
#EXIT
Direction west~
ToRoom    40302
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40306
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40305
Name     Scriptorium~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Rows of writing desks fill this room, each fitted with the
simple tools of transcription - ink, stylus, and a steady hand. Kaleth
maintains its collection the old way, copy by careful copy, rather
than trust everything to less permanent media.
~
#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    40302
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40308
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 40303 1 40305
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40306
Name     Hall of History~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Murals line both walls of this long hall, tracing the Je'daii
Order from the first Tho Yor's arrival through the founding of the
nine Temples and beyond. The furthest murals are noticeably less
finished than the rest - Kaleth's scholars are still deciding how
recent history ought to be told.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40304
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction up~
ToRoom    40307
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40307
Name     Restricted Archive~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Fewer records fill this smaller, locked-feeling room, but the
ones that do are older and stranger than anything in the Great
Archive below. Access here is not forbidden, exactly - simply
discouraged, and closely watched.
~
#EXIT
Direction down~
ToRoom    40306
#ENDEXIT

Reset O 0 40302 3 40307
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40308
Name     Cartography Room~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Maps cover every wall and much of the floor space here, ranging
from precise modern surveys to older, stranger charts whose accuracy
no one has fully verified. A few mark locations that don't appear to
exist on any current map of Tython at all.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40305
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ENDAREA
